        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In creating games, Into the Breach has become an indispensable source of inspiration for me due to its outstanding strategic depth and unique game mechanics. Here, I express my deepest respect and gratitude to the creators of Into the Breach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this turn-based strategy game, you'll pilot versatile mechs in thrilling duels against formidable foes. With each victory, you'll earn precious parts that will be invaluable resources for crafting your own unique mech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/b074591541e66234f7c2bd969092b2a6.poster.avif?t=1756898203\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/b074591541e66234f7c2bd969092b2a6.webm?t=1756898203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/b074591541e66234f7c2bd969092b2a6.mp4?t=1756898203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flexible and maneuverable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With exceptional mobility, the mech can launch surprise attacks or counter-offensives, ensuring you stay ahead on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/114009b29ab5ae244156f5234f5208f9.poster.avif?t=1756898203\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/114009b29ab5ae244156f5234f5208f9.webm?t=1756898203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/114009b29ab5ae244156f5234f5208f9.mp4?t=1756898203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seize the key point</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push enemies off the battlefield with clever maneuvers, or crush them with exceptional weaponry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/6d4863433413751a4c60bf6c8808f2b6.poster.avif?t=1756898203\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/6d4863433413751a4c60bf6c8808f2b6.webm?t=1756898203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/6d4863433413751a4c60bf6c8808f2b6.mp4?t=1756898203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this battlefield, terrain and enemy intelligence are equally crucial. Analyze your opponent meticulously, and cleverly exploit the environment to craft the perfect tactics, turning the enemy's attacks into your own offensive! Your counterattack will be as fierce as a sudden storm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/ea690cf1bc7ab33656aaec2b1de8b980.poster.avif?t=1756898203\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/ea690cf1bc7ab33656aaec2b1de8b980.webm?t=1756898203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble your own mech</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat foes, collect parts, and craft your unique mech. Equip powerful weapons and tackle tougher challenges! Your mech will be unstoppable on the battlefield!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In creating games, Into the Breach has become an indispensable source of inspiration for me due to its outstanding strategic depth and unique game mechanics. Here, I express my deepest respect and gratitude to the creators of Into the Breach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this turn-based strategy game, you'll pilot versatile mechs in thrilling duels against formidable foes. With each victory, you'll earn precious parts that will be invaluable resources for crafting your own unique mech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/b074591541e66234f7c2bd969092b2a6.poster.avif?t=1756898203\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/b074591541e66234f7c2bd969092b2a6.webm?t=1756898203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/b074591541e66234f7c2bd969092b2a6.mp4?t=1756898203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flexible and maneuverable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With exceptional mobility, the mech can launch surprise attacks or counter-offensives, ensuring you stay ahead on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/114009b29ab5ae244156f5234f5208f9.poster.avif?t=1756898203\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/114009b29ab5ae244156f5234f5208f9.webm?t=1756898203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/114009b29ab5ae244156f5234f5208f9.mp4?t=1756898203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seize the key point</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push enemies off the battlefield with clever maneuvers, or crush them with exceptional weaponry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/6d4863433413751a4c60bf6c8808f2b6.poster.avif?t=1756898203\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/6d4863433413751a4c60bf6c8808f2b6.webm?t=1756898203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/6d4863433413751a4c60bf6c8808f2b6.mp4?t=1756898203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this battlefield, terrain and enemy intelligence are equally crucial. Analyze your opponent meticulously, and cleverly exploit the environment to craft the perfect tactics, turning the enemy's attacks into your own offensive! Your counterattack will be as fierce as a sudden storm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/ea690cf1bc7ab33656aaec2b1de8b980.poster.avif?t=1756898203\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795410/extras/ea690cf1bc7ab33656aaec2b1de8b980.webm?t=1756898203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble your own mech</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat foes, collect parts, and craft your unique mech. Equip powerful weapons and tackle tougher challenges! Your mech will be unstoppable on the battlefield!</p>",
